{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-07_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-07","title":"只是从天而降！","storyCode":"6-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"82150d24adc6dcc8baffaa8f3bf87147500f0e5ee9ef3552b5b88d26ef0cf08c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"煌与霜星势均力敌，然而，交战的余波使得建筑开始崩塌，博士与霜星双双落入空洞中。\n罗德岛与雪怪小队暂时休战。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事！他们还......真有点本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没被冻着吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"让区域内的空气变热阻绝她的寒流，也只有你能做到了。多亏了你，我们没什么损伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"小意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"用冰的，你怎么不用致死性法术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星她那个样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......帮我......遮一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"快走，阿米娅。路上可能还有其他的整合运动。有伤员吗？我可以搭把手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"想这样就撤退？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我劝你一句。别再战斗了，白毛兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"再这么强撑着用法术，你会死得很快。你的力量正在把你的活力榨干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以来罗德岛。至少我们有办法延续你的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么一副......怜悯他人的样子？谁需要你们的怜悯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，我看起来像是在可怜你？你挺强的，我是看得起你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"凭什么让你们逃走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，快走，别看她了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"有整合运动在外围废墟向我们移动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"别想走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊，你现在站的那个位置！别用那个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以放他们走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛会对龙门的同胞做什么，谁也不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"温差升高，结构，脆化！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......冻结！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......♪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"起作用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们埋设的源石改变了下层结构，地块已经开始倾斜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊，你那个位置太危险了，快抱住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......煌，听见没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"这是建筑物的碎裂声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"埋设源石，吸热，温差......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"断裂的建筑墙体，难道......霜星的法术，也可以这样发挥作用吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这块地块在变形！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动还能做到这种事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"说不清，但......整片区域在下沉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！去稳固的区域呆着，这里的地块要沉陷了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你脚下......开裂了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"完蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}！跳过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"跳什么......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，别去！Dr.{@nickname}，先抓住那根电线杆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"先救博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"地面撕裂倾斜的速度太快了，我够不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......没事的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"周围的建筑物承受不了自重，正在坠落！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"陨星，接好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我带阿米娅走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"放手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你走，我来帮博士！相信我作为罗德岛干员的实力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，看来还是要流点血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我会用气流和真空压减缓你的坠落速度，撑开你身边的建筑，放心，它们压不到你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不要怕！千万不要怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......一会儿见！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一会儿见。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？霜星呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们的指挥官也掉下去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"要么我们别打了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的兔子，我们暂时休战怎么样？其实我们一开始也不太想和你们打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是各位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特告知大姊，说你杀了亚历克斯，所以大姊非常担忧你们接下来的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......亚历克斯是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉。碎骨确实是被我杀害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者本来不该相互为敌的。很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么好道歉的？你们当时在交战吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们停火吧。大熊，你怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？*乌萨斯粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大熊说他也没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得他不是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不在交战状态，就没理由再让谁去杀谁了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你......会想要停战？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我们两边领袖都是兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我脑海里似乎有什么东西崩溃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"冻原的雪怪居然是这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"什，什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不应该冷血无情，冰块一样吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是偏见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，听我说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"战斗的胜负，你们究竟去哪，我们都不关心。我们更在乎大姊的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也在关注队友的安危，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。我们不是为了伤害谁才深入废城的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，你们不是来搞什么“整合运动感染者大猎杀”的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们倒......不太能否认这个事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是因为爱国者大爹说整合运动需要团结，我们这就把梅菲斯特和参与他行动的小队全部干掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那也算整合运动大猎杀了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起挖开这里，怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["陨星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
